    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #305\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed branch `bb/relay-275-review-debt-10-12-validate-relation-ta-thr_secgfxckfj` to origin.\n\n## Summary\n\nFixes the three post-merge review findings against #21, tracked in #275:\n\n1. **Validate relation targets** — `createRelationPropertyWithClient` in `backend/packages/data/src/chokePoint/chokePoint.ts` now reads the target database with `databasesStore.getDatabase` before creating anything, and throws `ValidationError` naming `targetDatabaseId` when it doesn't exist. This applies whether or not `input.inverse` is set.\n2. **Allow `locked: true` relation properties** — the property is now created unlocked, `updatePropertyConfig` attaches `relationDefinitionId`/`targetDatabaseId` as before, and the caller's `locked` flag is applied afterward via a new narrow setter, `propertiesStore.setPropertyLocked` (styled after `setPropertyMigrationStatus`). This avoids ever calling `updatePropertyConfig` against an already-locked property. The inverse property still keeps its current unlocked creation.\n3. **Guard archived-database writes** — added `assertDatabaseNotArchived` in `chokePoint.ts`, called at the top of the exported `createItemWithClient` and `updateItemWithClient` (not only the `createChokePoint(...)` facade wrappers), so every declared owning process writing through them is covered. Rejects with `ValidationError` naming the database. Reads, soft-delete, and restore are unaffected.\n\nAdded tests to `backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/chokePoint.test.ts` covering: rejection of a non-existent `targetDatabaseId` with and without an inverse (verifying no orphaned property/relation-definition rows), a successful locked relation-property creation with correct config, and archived-database rejection of both item creation and update while confirming the same calls succeed pre-archive.\n\nVerified: full backend test suite (24 files, 317 tests) passes, and `pnpm -r run build` (TypeScript compilation across all workspace packages) is clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
